  << Clocks, environment, line separator and the system property table, over
     the SLeeLa time and os builtins. getenv returns null for an unset or empty
     variable (the os builtin cannot tell the two apart). Properties set with
     setProperty live in a small key/value table that shadows the built-in
     defaults (os.name, user.name, user.dir, line.separator, file.separator,
     path.separator). exit, arraycopy, identityHashCode, the stream setters and
     the security manager keep their exact-signature stubs until the VM offers
     those operations. >>
